# --- IMPORTANT: data/ is INTENTIONALLY NOT ignored. ---
# GitHub Actions runners are ephemeral — nothing written during a run
# survives to the next one unless it's committed back to the repo. The
# continuous-monitor workflow commits data/paper_trading_journal.jsonl
# (and reports/) at the end of every run specifically so the validation
# record persists. If you later move to a real database, delete this
# block and add data/ above.
